{
	"nodes":[
		{
			"id":"1dab1776ee3a320f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Psionics.** You have a strong connection to the fabric of the world. Your thoughts and intentions echo from your very soul into the world around you, but it comes at a cost. ==When you cast a spell, suffer the \"Drained\" **[Minor Metaphysical Harm](Harm)**==",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-240,
			"y":-80,
			"width":520,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"0ea4b48c8e3d3c8b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Potent Manifestation.** You have gotten used to your psionic power and have the ability to push it even further. ==You no longer suffer **[[Harm]]** when casting spells, however, but you may choose to take the \"Drained\" **[Minor Metaphysical Harm](Harm)** to increase your dice pool by 1 per skill obtained in psionics==",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-240,
			"y":-400,
			"width":520,
			"height":160
		},
		{
			"id":"649fde0818d68e34",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Dangerous Manifestation.** You can increase your dice pool as described in **** an amount of times equal to half of your **Spellcraft [[Die Max]]** times",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-240,
			"y":-700,
			"width":520,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"4fc600b13b8c75ec",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Controlled Manifestation.** When you utilize **Dangerous Manifestation**, roll **Fortitude** or **Will**. On a success, you do not take harm. This must be rolled for each instance of harm",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-240,
			"y":-980,
			"width":520,
			"height":100
		}
	],
